dance Stampede
// The bass pushes the morph; the snares bring it nearer; the highs set how fast it spins and the
// highs turn it; drops in the middle reverse it.
// Inspired by stampedor, a DancerDNA music style.

morph   follows music.bass  speed 1.66  settle 0.09
zoom    follows music.mid_hit  amount 0.5  settle 68.5
spin    follows music.high  from 0 to 195  smooth 2.5
turn    on music.high changes  by 0.26
reverse on music.mid drops  by 0.41  on 132 off 132
